        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "傍城借主，必须详细审察依托与落脉的情况；就向拗龙，应当仔细斟酌明堂中的气机变化。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000912-p000-1539d3b08a",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "有弦有棱则形态真实，若涌若凸则气机已到。辨认气比辨认脉更难，安葬脉脉哪里比得上安葬气。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000913-p000-c417dae1e2",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "法葬的葬法，法度蕴含在形中；会意的葬法，意趣显现在形外。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000914-p000-cfb45f2df5",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "龙的贵贱以格来辨别，龙的支干以祖来辨别，龙的大小以干来辨别。所以同龙论格，同格论祖，同祖论干。龙的去住以局来辨别，龙的正偏以堂来辨别，龙的真伪以座来辨别。所以同龙论局，同局论堂，同堂论座。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000915-p000-ccae09ce75",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "凶星不无夹杂，只要有胎有化。吉曜总然雄耸，亦要有精有神。山谷变迁，山川变色，造物固自有时。控制山川，打动龙虎，作用各自有法。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000916-p000-820b25c6c5",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "heading",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "## 理气篇——运用卦、数、方位、时间等关系判断吉凶的方法",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000917-p000-7a09792e6f",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "大地没有精气，以星光为精气；大地没有吉凶，以星气为吉凶。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000918-p000-2f49c050ed",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "用先天来统御龙，若要辨别四龙天星；用后天来布局，尤其应当审察三般卦例。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000919-p000-2ee3020e41",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "以龙定穴，必须审察入路的阴阳；以水定向，必须审察归路的阴阳。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000920-p000-026e0f6291",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "入首入手，则龙与脉的取用由辨来定；分金分经，则来与坐的取用由分来定。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000921-p000-8f3cc5cf34",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "脉看左右，落则脉可辨真伪；气审左右，加则气可别淳漓。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000922-p000-0c2b03390b",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "四库存目青囊汇刊[二] 九天元女青囊海角经卷四。此处“元女”具体所指不详。",
        "confidence": "medium",
        "uncertainty": [
          "元女"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000923-p000-c544702505",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "龙脉有顺逆，乘气自当有辨；五行有颠倒，作用各自有法。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000924-p000-b5ccd685e4",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "气有乘本脉而不容他杂者，气有借傍脉而可隔山取者，气有合初分脉而不为遥远者，气有串渡峡脉而不为邀截者。总之，龙气无尺寸之移，受气有腰耳之异；分金有转移之巧，气线无毫发之差。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000925-p000-f015f246dc",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "中气当避乘气，故取三七放棺；旺气宜乘分金，亦取三七加向。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000926-p000-54c8add618",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "脉不直而气直，何畏直来直受；气不斜而棺斜，乃为正贯正乘。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000927-p000-19930954bd",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "龙以脉为主，穴以向为尊，水以向而定，向以局而分。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000928-p000-1e2f87a433",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "来路看四生，坐下看四绝，局内看三合，向上看双金。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book001-b000929-p000-171f19c518",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "制煞莫如乘旺，脱煞正以扶生，从煞乃化为权，留煞正尔迎官。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
